{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>You trampled</b> — Behold, the enemy is poised to come to besiege us, and You trampled the sea with Your horses. The meaning: Your cloud led them to the sea, until its waters turned back, like a wall, and did not water the land of Israel. And on account of this the prophet speaks this prophecy in the language of Israel."], :book :habakkuk, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["<b>Ibn Ezra on Habakkuk</b>- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/havakuk"] ["Ibn Ezra on Habakkuk -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/havakuk"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:49:14.864887859Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}